# Implementation Plan - Dhvani Rakshak (AI-Powered Real-Time Voice Cloning Detection & Prevention System)

Dhvani Rakshak is an enterprise-grade, real-time voice authentication and anti-spoofing platform designed to protect financial transactions, executive calls, and contact centers from AI voice cloning attacks with sub-2-second latency.

## User Review Required

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **Key Architectural Decisions & Zero Audio Storage Policy**
> - **Zero Raw Audio Retention**: Audio payload is processed strictly in volatile RAM buffers. Only 192-dimensional vector embeddings and acoustic feature fingerprints are encrypted and persisted.
> - **Multilingual Dialect Tuning**: Dynamic prosodic baseline adjustments for 8 major Indian languages (Hindi, Tamil, Telugu, Kannada, Malayalam, Marathi, Bengali, Gujarati) + Indian English variants.
> - **Tri-Layer Dynamic Ensemble Scoring**: Acoustic/Spectral (40%), Prosody/Behavioral (30%), Speaker Consistency (30%).

## Open Questions

